## 10. {{SCRIPTS}} — optional automation

*{{EPI_SCRIPTS}}*

{{INTRO_SCRIPTS}} The harness ships a dependency-free CLI (`geneseed
build|doctor|diff|status|setup|web`, plus `geneseed-hook` for the verbs a host
fires on its own) that can be wired into your host's hooks or into CI — notably
`geneseed-hook context`, which injects the project context at session start so
this read is enforced by the hook rather than left to you. All of it is
opt-in; the harness works without any of it.

---

*{{BENEDICTION}}*
